msgstr "Business"

msgid "Staat op elke factuur: naam, adres, KvK, btw-nummer, bank en e-mail."
msgstr "On every invoice: name, address, KvK, VAT number, bank and e-mail."

msgid "KOR"
msgstr "KOR"

msgid ""
"De KOR-tekst onder je facturen, en wanneer je hoort dat je omzet de grens "
"nadert."
msgstr ""
"The KOR text below your invoices, and when you hear that your revenue is "
"nearing the limit."

