msgstr "Reading receipts with AI"

msgid ""
"Met je eigen AI-dienst en API-sleutel maakt Huismus van elk nieuw bonnetje "
"een uitgave om na te kijken."
msgstr ""
"With your own AI service and API key, Huismus turns each new receipt into an "
"expense for you to check."

msgid "Exporteren"
msgstr "Export"

msgid "Al je facturen, offertes, klanten en uitgaven in één ZIP."
msgstr "All your invoices, quotes, customers and expenses in one ZIP."

