"en de database bewaken ze."
msgstr ""
"A few rules are strict, because this is someone's bookkeeping. The tests and "
"the database guard them."

msgid ""
"<strong>Geld in centen:</strong> bedragen zijn hele getallen, nooit een "
"float."
msgstr "<strong>Money in cents:</strong> amounts are integers, never a float."

